      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Batch ingestion** \u2013 every CSV file loaded in one go (master data, warehouse, original sales, hospital demand). Rows processed = `len(df)` of the file, load duration = end time \u2212 start time. Bottom half: data-quality checks run on every staged batch."
      }
